s → Link → Placement → Calibration → Scoring → Correct → Summary → Replay. Home also leads to Practice, Rules and the Pro upgrade. Screens 4–6 run on the camera phone; 7 runs on the iPad.", "size": "m", "fill": "gray", "page": "mvp"}, "navTitle": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Home screen — options A–D, and E combining the picks", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2270, "page": "nav"}, "v1Title": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "v1 screens — gameplay, practice, history, rules", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2270, "page": "v1"}, "v1Brief": {"x": 2350, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Home is option E on the Home navigation page; its tabs and Start buttons now lead here. Scoring and Bob's 27 are playable: tap the board (or switch to Keypad), then Next to let the bot throw.", "size": "m", "fill": "gray", "page": "v1"}}, "designSystems": []}